{"id":"plaza","lemma":"plaza","pos":"noun","rank":2023,"glosses":["plaza, town square","fortified town","seat"],"ipa":"/ˈplaθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"plazas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-plaza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Había muchos niños en la plaza.","en":"There were many children in the square.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689532","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Es más arriba de la plaza.","en":"It's past the square.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800795","words":[null,null,{"g":"come on!"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"furthermore"],[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Mira aquel palo en la plaza.","en":"Look at that pole in the square.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706619","words":[{"g":"target"},{"g":"that (over there"},{"g":"stake, stick, wood"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La policía ha despejado la plaza.","en":"The police have cleared the square.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"clear, all-clear"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ellos están construyendo una nueva plaza.","en":"They're building a new square.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to build","l":"construir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"news, novelty"},null]}]}